* Nightly billing run report: totals posted premium by product.
FILE POSTED
  PST-POL-NUMBER   1 10 A
  PST-PREMIUM     11  5 P 2
  PST-PRODUCT     24  4 A
W-TOTAL   W 7 P 2 VALUE 0
JOB INPUT POSTED
  PERFORM ACCUMULATE
  PRINT RUN-REPORT
ACCUMULATE. PROC
  IF PST-PREMIUM > 0
    W-TOTAL = W-TOTAL + PST-PREMIUM
  END-IF
END-PROC
REPORT RUN-REPORT LINESIZE 80
  SEQUENCE PST-PRODUCT
  CONTROL PST-PRODUCT
  TITLE 1 'POLICY BILLING - NIGHTLY RUN'
  LINE 1 PST-PRODUCT PST-POL-NUMBER PST-PREMIUM
